WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.590
Lamp for reps. Part eight: Messages.

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:07.280
Talk to your team and your merchants, without leaving Lamp.

3
00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:10.780
Messages sits on the right of every staff page.

4
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.440
Switch tabs, and it stays open beside your work.

5
00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:26.990
The number beside Messages is how many conversations have something new. A green dot marks each one.

6
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.820
Rooms are group chats. All staff reaches everyone.

7
00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:35.610
A team room is the team lead, and the reps who report to them.

8
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:39.300
Click a room to open it. Type at the bottom, and press Send.

9
00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:53.330
For one person, click New message, pick who, and open the conversation. Only the two of you see it.

10
00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:59.100
Merchants holds a conversation for each of your files, once either of you has written.

11
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:04.450
Click one to read it, and answer. The merchant sees your reply on their account page.

12
00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:13.480
The same conversation is on the file, under Messages with the merchant.

13
00:01:13.970 --> 00:01:20.160
If a merchant hasn't read your reply after fifteen minutes, Lamp emails them that a message is waiting.

14
00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:28.120
Need the room? Close the panel at its top corner. The Messages button brings it back, with a count of what's new.

15
00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:32.330
On your phone, tap Messages to open it full screen.

16
00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.260
Next: applications on the phone.
